  "chapter": 1,
  "title": "12冠，锦织圭坚持到底",
  "publication_candidate": true,
  "narration_units": [
    {
      "id": "compact-01",
      "text_zh": "十八岁拿下第一座巡回赛冠军。锦织圭，把亚洲男子网球带向了更远的地方。",
      "placement": "intro",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural",
      "author_voice_not_player": true,
      "audio_path": null,
      "duration_seconds": null
    },
    {
      "id": "compact-02",
      "text_zh": "东京、孟菲斯、巴塞罗那。从第一座到第十二座，每一次捧杯，都有自己的重量。",
      "placement": "title_reactions",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural",
      "author_voice_not_player": true,
      "audio_path": null,
      "duration_seconds": null
    },
    {
      "id": "compact-03",
      "text_zh": "费德勒、纳达尔、德约科维奇，他都赢过。美网击败德约，让他走进大满贯决赛。",
      "placement": "big_three_and_us2014",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural",
      "author_voice_not_player": true,
      "audio_path": null,
      "duration_seconds": null
    },
    {
      "id": "compact-04",
      "text_zh": "决赛没能夺冠，但他成为了首位晋级大满贯男单决赛的亚洲球员。",
      "placement": "us2014_final",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural",
      "author_voice_not_player": true,
      "audio_path": null,
      "duration_seconds": null
    },
    {
      "id": "compact-05",
      "text_zh": "里约拿下铜牌。同年回到纽约，他再进四强。那些漫长的第五盘，他从不轻易交出去。",
      "placement": "rio_and_murray",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural",
      "author_voice_not_player": true,
      "audio_path": null,
      "duration_seconds": null
    },
    {
      "id": "compact-06",
      "text_zh": "伤病让他停下，也让归来变得更难。可他还是回到年终舞台，再次击败费德勒。",
      "placement": "finals2018",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural",
      "author_voice_not_player": true,
      "audio_path": null,
      "duration_seconds": null
    },
    {
      "id": "compact-07",
      "text_zh": "十二冠的最后一座在布里斯班。伤病让他走了很多弯路，却没让他放弃回到球场。",
      "placement": "brisbane_and_ao2025",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural",
      "author_voice_not_player": true,
      "audio_path": null,
      "duration_seconds": null
    },
    {
      "id": "compact-08",
      "text_zh": "2026年10月1日，东京。最后一场巡回赛结束，把最后的话留给他自己。",
      "placement": "tokyo_before_real_speech",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural",
      "author_voice_not_player": true,
      "audio_path": null,
      "duration_seconds": null
    }
  ],
